&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is the trusted source for open source. By delivering hardened, secure, and production-ready builds of all the open source software engineers and AI agents rely on, Chainguard helps organizations build faster, stay compliant, and eliminate risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our customers include Fortune 500 enterprises and global industry leaders, including Anduril, Canva, Fortinet, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, OpenAI, Snap Inc., and Snowflake. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chainguard is venture-backed by leading investors, including Amplify, IVP, Kleiner Perkins, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Mantis VC, Redpoint Ventures, Sequoia Capital, and Spark Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role, in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chainguard&#39;s international business is past the proving stage — the teams, the motion, and the early wins are in place across both EMEA and APAC. We&#39;re looking for a Director, Sales Operations to run the operational engine behind it. You&#39;ll lead our existing sales operations team and own the planning, forecasting, territory design, reporting, and process rigor that keep a multi-country, multi-segment, multi-timezone business running at speed. You&#39;ll act as the direct revenue operations partner to our GVP, EMEA, our RVP, APAC, and their VPs, reporting into our global Revenue Operations leader — inheriting global standards and systems and adapting them for the realities of selling across UK&amp;amp;I, DACH, the Nordics, France, Benelux, Southern Europe, the Middle East, ANZ, Japan, India, and ASEAN. This is a role for someone who wants to own two regions end-to-end while staying tightly connected to a global function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop the existing Sales Operations team supporting EMEA and APAC — set priorities, raise the bar on quality, and grow the team as both regions scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the direct revenue operations partner to the GVP, EMEA, and the RVP, APAC, and their leadership teams — the single point of accountability for planning, forecasting, reporting, and operational decision support across both regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit in both the EMEA and APAC leadership rhythms: attend and shape leadership meetings, staff meetings, and QBRs, and bring the data and recommendations that let the GVP, the RVP, and their leaders make calls quickly and confidently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend that partnership down the org to regional VPs and front-line managers, while acting as the EMEA and APAC voice inside the global GTM Operations function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own annual and in-year territory design across both regions — carve equitable, data-backed territories spanning UK&amp;amp;I, DACH, Nordics, France, Benelux, Southern Europe, the Middle East, ANZ, Japan, India, and ASEAN, accounting for language, entity, segment, and account-potential differences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run capacity and coverage modeling for EMEA and APAC: headcount plans, ramp assumptions, quota allocation, and productivity targets tied to the company financial plan — including how a maturing EMEA business and an earlier-stage APAC business warrant different assumptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the forecast cadence for both regions — weekly pipeline inspection, forecast calls, roll-up accuracy, and the narrative that goes to global sales and finance leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the operating reporting rhythm for both regions: weekly performance, monthly business reviews, QBRs, and EMEA and APAC inputs to Board materials — surfacing the trends that materially affect the growth trajectory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pipeline health and funnel analytics end-to-end: conversion rates by stage, segment, region, and country; source and campaign contribution; win/loss patterns; and the levers behind each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data integrity and hygiene standards in Salesforce and the broader GTM stack across both regions — account ownership, hierarchy, segmentation, and reporting fields that hold up under scrutiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global GTM Operations on system and process changes, ensuring EMEA and APAC requirements are represented and that regional adaptations don&#39;t fragment the global architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales compensation execution for both regions in partnership with global Sales Ops and Finance — plan rollout, quota letters, and accurate, on-time attainment reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Marketing, BDR, Customer Success, Finance, and Legal to remove friction from the EMEA and APAC GTM process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain governance and rules of engagement across EMEA and APAC teams and segments, and arbitrate cleanly when coverage or credit questions arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring region-specific operational requirements — data residency, GDPR and APAC privacy regimes, and local entity and currency considerations — into process and reporting design in partnership with Legal and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Sales, Revenue, or GTM Operations experience, including significant time in high-growth Enterprise B2B SaaS, is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing and developing a sales operations team is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of multi-country international territory design, quota allocation, and capacity planning is a must — EMEA experience is essential, APAC exposure is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, expert-level Salesforce fluency — reporting, data models, process design, and the judgment to know what belongs in the CRM and what doesn&#39;t — is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of running a forecast cadence that sales leadership trusts, with measurable improvement in forecast accuracy, is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical foundation: able to break ambiguous problems into concrete components and land on a defensible recommendation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator who can move between a front-line manager&#39;s pipeline question and an executive-level narrative without changing the underlying facts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success as the trusted operations partner to senior revenue leaders (GVP/VP/GM level) — able to earn a seat in the leadership rhythm, tell them what they need to hear, and be relied on for the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to support multiple regional leaders at once with different levels of business maturity, without defaulting to whichever one is loudest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating as a regional leader inside a globally managed function — comfortable inheriting standards, pushing back where they don&#39;t fit, and not fragmenting the system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the modern GTM stack (Salesforce, Outreach, Gong, HubSpot, CPQ, Sigma/Tableau/Looker) and a strong aptitude for picking up new tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with international operating complexity: multiple currencies, legal entities, languages, data privacy regimes, and a working day that spans EMEA and APAC timezones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who flourishes in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and can hold multiple priorities without dropping any&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across EMEA and APAC and to the US for QBRs and planning cycles (~25%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public sector or regulated-industry GTM operations experience is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL or building data models directly is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£165,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£210,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We live and breathe our company values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer obsessed — We focus on delivering solutions to our customers that create value and make their lives better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a bias for intentional action — We prioritize, plan, try things, and fail fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t take ourselves too seriously (but we do serious work) — We are solving an important problem which takes focus, but we also like to enjoy the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We trust each other and assume good intentions — We&#39;re transparent with decisions to empower team members to make well informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few of the benefits we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible &amp;amp; Remote-First Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work remotely with team meetup opportunities, bi-annual destination summits, and a monthly stipend for coworking spaces, phone and internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive stock options upon hire and promotion. Plus, you can participate in secondary offerings and have 10 years to exercise your options (yes, you read that correctly: 10 years!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100% Covered Health Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover 100% of your health, vision and dental insurance premiums for you and your dependents. Nothing comes out of your paycheck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∞ Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Take the time you need – to do our best work, we need to recharge and reset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;18 Weeks Paid Parental Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer 18 weeks for birthing parents and 12 weeks for non-birthing parents, with the option to use it all at once or throughout your child&#39;s first year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your experience is close but doesn&#39;t fulfill all requirements, please apply. We&#39;re building the best team in technology and are focused on hiring &quot;Chainguardians&quot; with unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
